    ["A gift from a friend, with the author's signature on the title page. He also wrote 'Mist Harbor', that play from the year before last about dock workers."] = "A gift from a friend, with the author's signature on the title page. He also wrote 'Mist Harbor,' the play from two years ago about dockworkers.",
