    ["At the very least, he is definitely not the you of today."] = "At the very least, he is definitely not who you are today.",
    ["August 11th, 8:00 PM, Mrs. Lowis, who made a living by gluing matchboxes on Lower Street, Iron Cross Street, died suddenly of an illness.\nAugust 11th, 10:00 PM, dock worker Zide jumped into the Tussock River, ending his life of poverty.\nAugust 11th, 11:00 PM, inside the West District Poorhouse, the bankrupt Sols attempted to commit arson to create a tragedy, but in the end, only burned himself to death.\nAugust 12th, 3:00 PM, dock factory area, Hayley suddenly collapsed and died.\n..."] = "August 11, 8:00 PM: Mrs. Lowis, who made a living gluing matchboxes on Lower Street in the Iron Cross district, died suddenly of an illness.\nAugust 11, 10:00 PM: Dockworker Zide jumped into the Tussock River, ending his life of poverty.\nAugust 11, 11:00 PM: At the West District Poorhouse, the bankrupt Sols attempted to start a deadly fire, but succeeded only in burning himself to death.\nAugust 12, 3:00 PM: Hayley suddenly collapsed and died in the docklands factory district.\n...",
