    ["Behind the desk, a middle-aged man wearing a skull captain's hat and a pale face watched Alger walk over step by step, saying through gritted teeth in anger:\n \"I will not submit!\"\n \"I believe you can do it.\" Alger was as calm as if he were saying the weather today wasn't very good.\n \"You...\" The middle-aged man was stunned, as if he hadn't expected such an answer.\n Just then, Alger's body arched slightly, and he suddenly lunged forward, instantly closing the distance between the two to just the desk.\n Slap!\n His shoulder tightened, and his right hand reached out violently, gripping the middle-aged man's throat.\n Without giving the opponent a chance to react, phantom fish scales appeared on the back of his hand, and his five fingers exerted crazy force.\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 8: A New Era"] = "Behind the desk, a middle-aged man with a pale face and wearing a skull captain's hat watched Alger walk over step by step, saying through gritted teeth in anger:\n \"I will not submit!\"\n \"I believe you can do it.\" Alger was as calm as if he were saying the weather today wasn't very good.\n \"You...\" The middle-aged man was stunned, as if he hadn't expected such an answer.\n Just then, Alger's body arched slightly, and he suddenly lunged forward, instantly closing the distance between the two to just the desk.\n Slap!\n His shoulder tightened, and his right hand reached out violently, gripping the middle-aged man's throat.\n Without giving the opponent a chance to react, phantom fish scales appeared on the back of his hand, and he squeezed with all his might.\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 8: A New Era",
    ["Benson and I are about the same size, he can wear my tuxedo. Melissa, you should buy a new dress. If you don't look for expensive fabrics or the latest designs, it won't be too expensive."] = "Benson and I are about the same size, so he can wear my tuxedo. Melissa, you should buy a new dress. If you don't insist on expensive fabrics or the latest designs, it won't cost too much.",
