    ["Sober people are always full of lies; the truth is often hidden within dreams. I trust the you in your dreams more than the sober you."] = "Sober people are always full of lies; the truth is often hidden within dreams. I trust the version of you in your dreams more than your waking self.",
    ["Star Light Blade"] = "Starlight Blade",
    ["Storm be above."] = "By the Storm!",
    ["Sylvia intermittently summons a march of rot-fungi and summons a hurricane to knock back players."] = "Sylvia intermittently summons marching rot-fungi and a hurricane to knock back players.",
    ["Sylvia intermittently summons a march of rot-fungi and summons a monsoon to knock back players."] = "Sylvia intermittently summons marching rot-fungi and a monsoon to knock back players.",
    ["That was the me of the daytime, the sober me, the restrained me. But now... alcohol makes me honest. The me of the night wants something else."] = "That was my daytime self: sober and restrained. But now... alcohol makes me honest. My nighttime self wants something else.",
    ["The awake are always full of lies, while the truth is often hidden in dreams. Compared to the awake you, I trust the you in the dream more."] = "Those who are awake are always full of lies, while the truth is often hidden in dreams. I trust the version of you in your dreams more than your waking self.",
    ["The distance between you is too great; lying down together failed."] = "You are too far apart to lie down together.",
    ["The downward slash of Slash of Glory additionally generates a 5-meter radius area at the location, lasting 5 seconds, continuously dealing damage to enemies within the gravity field and granting Damage Reduction to allies."] = "The downward strike of Glory Slash additionally creates a 5-meter-radius area at the location for 5 seconds, continuously damaging enemies within the gravity field and granting Damage Reduction to allies.",
    ["The downward slash of Slash of Glory additionally generates a 5-meter radius area at the location, lasting 5 seconds. The area continuously deals damage to enemies and provides 30% Damage Reduction to allies."] = "The downward strike of Glory Slash additionally creates a 5-meter-radius area at the location for 5 seconds. The area continuously damages enemies and grants allies 30% Damage Reduction.",
    ["The left half of the indigo curtain has a heavy texture, and the gold threads dotted on it are stars and flowers."] = "The left half of the indigo curtain has a heavy texture, with gold threads forming stars and flowers across it.",
    ["The moment you write down the other person's name, a period of time belonging solely to you is born."] = "The moment you write down the other person's name, a chapter of time belonging only to the two of you begins.",
    ["The one behind you is the guardian spirit symbolizing wealth; it is clad in golden armor, holding—"] = "Exactly! Ah—the great being! I can feel its breath!",
    ["The time spent with you is always so pleasant, let me enjoy this moment of peace a little longer."] = "The time I spend with you is always so pleasant. Let me enjoy this moment of peace a little longer.",
    ["Then shouldn't the knight help it find what it's looking for instead of fighting..."] = "So it breathes fire to provide light? And the dark clouds appear when it is sad?",
    ["There's still so much stuff... A new employee handbook, what a strange name?"] = "There's still so much stuff... A new employee handbook—what a strange title!",
    ["Thirty soli in compensation, the dock worker has never seen so much money in his life!"] = "Thirty soli in compensation—the dockworker has never seen so much money in his life!",
    ["This {{Mr.|Ms.}}, you are dressed very interestingly. Miss Elsa and I are doing design research."] = "{{Mr.|Ms.}}, your outfit is quite interesting. Miss Elsa and I are gathering inspiration for our designs.",
    ["Thomas loved to tell jokes, and Eleanor would laugh behind the counter, unable to even hold her cup steady... tsk tsk, back then, it was so good."] = "From morning till night, the shop was packed with people, and laughter carried from one end to the other.",
