    ["Used for floating and knockup hits. Reads constants from the attacktype table. Represents the time for the character to get up after falling. Generally not recommended to modify."] = "Used for launch and knockback hits. Reads constants from the attacktype table. Represents the time it takes a character to get up after being knocked down. Generally, modifying this is not recommended.",
    ["Viscountess summons 2 <Disable> Butler's Obsession bodies </> and 1 <Disable> Little Viscount's Obsession body </> on the field. Players who touch the Butler's Obsession body will be bound and <Disable> suffer continuous HP loss </>. If the obsession body is not touched by anyone or the Butler is not killed, it will provide a damage boost to the Viscountess."] = "The Viscountess summons 2 <Disable> Butler Obsession manifestations </> and 1 <Disable> Little Viscount Obsession manifestation </> on the field. Players who touch a Butler Obsession manifestation will be bound and <Disable> continuously lose HP </>. If no one touches an obsession manifestation or the Butler is not killed, it grants the Viscountess a damage boost.",
    ["Waking up in a bright café, before you is a noble young lady, and a... golden retriever?"] = "You awaken in a bright café. Before you stand a noble young lady and a... golden retriever?",
    ["When receiving attacks from a Summon, negates {*.1f**,F1690001,CreateHurtDivi} of their Suppression. (Reduces the attacker's Suppression to a maximum of 0)"] = "When attacked by a Summon, negate {*.1f**,F1690001,CreateHurtDivi} of its Suppression. (The attacker's Suppression cannot be reduced below 0)",
    ["When receiving attacks from a Summon, negates {*d,F1690001,CreateHurtReduce} points of their Special Attack. (Reduces the attacker's Special Attack to a maximum of 0)"] = "When attacked by a Summon, negate {*d,F1690001,CreateHurtReduce} points of its Special Attack. (The attacker's Special Attack cannot be reduced below 0)",
    ["Why does it have to be me who encounters this kind of thing? Am I really that unlucky?"] = "Why did something like this have to happen to me? Am I really that unlucky?",
    ["Why does it have to be me who lights it!"] = "Why do I have to light it?!",
